            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "\\begin{aligned}f'(x)&=\\frac{2x-4x^3}{2\\sqrt{x^2-x^4}}\\\\[3pt]\\frac{2x-4x^3}{2\\sqrt{x^2-x^4}}&=0\\\\2x-4x^3&=0\\\\2x(1-2x^2)&=0\\\\\\therefore x&=0,\\ \\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}",
